From ce5aa95aab592d0724cdf9615fa8a6cd0c789114 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "D.R.racer" <drracer@seznam.cz>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:40:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ucm2: Fairphone/fp5: enable ADC1 in the VoiceCall verb

The microphone gives only zeros during calls. wcd938x applies its
SoundWire port switches ('ADC1 Switch' sets a port channel mask) only
when the capture stream is set up: wcd938x_sdw_hw_params() passes the
mask to sdw_stream_add_slave() once, and the SoundWire core cannot add
ports to a stream that is already prepared or enabled.

On the HiFi -> Voice Call switch the HiFi Mic1 DisableSequence turns
'ADC1 Switch' off, PulseAudio then opens the capture on
TX_CODEC_DMA_TX_3, and only about 150 ms later the VoiceCall Mic1
EnableSequence turns the switch on again. The stream was set up without
the ADC1 port, and the hostless VoiceMMode1 capture keeps that stream
running for the whole call.

Turn 'ADC1 Switch' on in the verb EnableSequence, which runs before any
stream of the new verb opens. The Mic1 device sequences stay as they
are; setting the switch again there is harmless, and the device
DisableSequence still turns it off when the verb is left.

This is a workaround for the ordering, not a fix of the underlying
behaviour of the codec driver.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 ucm2/Fairphone/fp5/VoiceCall.conf | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ucm2/Fairphone/fp5/VoiceCall.conf b/ucm2/Fairphone/fp5/VoiceCall.conf
index e577081..dfbf36c 100644
--- a/ucm2/Fairphone/fp5/VoiceCall.conf
+++ b/ucm2/Fairphone/fp5/VoiceCall.conf
@@ -7,6 +7,12 @@ SectionVerb {
 		cset "name='MultiMedia2 Mixer TX_CODEC_DMA_TX_3' 1"
 		cset "name='QUIN_MI2S_RX Voice Mixer VoiceMMode1' 1"
 		cset "name='VoiceMMode1 Capture Mixer TX_CODEC_DMA_TX_3' 1"
+
+		# wcd938x applies its SoundWire port switches only when the capture stream is set up. PulseAudio
+		# starts the capture before the Mic1 device EnableSequence runs, and the call helpers then keep
+		# that stream running, so the mic would stay silent for the whole call. Enable the port here,
+		# before any stream opens.
+		cset "name='ADC1 Switch' 1"
 	]
 
 	DisableSequence [
-- 
2.55.0

